WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.820
Her Highness the Princess will 
make a speech! Listen carefully!

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.570
Who cares about a speech?!

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:38.950
When it comes to war, it's always us, 
the people, who suffer!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.660
And a rebellion?! Stop using the citizens 
in a fight with your own family!

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.370
We'll never side with a rebel army!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.380
Not unless a super beautiful woman 
who's exactly my type begs me!

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.760
Please, everyone! Won't you please help me?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.200
Nakam!

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.080
It's true that Nakam has a weakness for women 
who fit the standard image of beauty,

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.190
but I prefer the cute devilish type.

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:06.310
No well-bred young lady 
is going to blow my mind.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.100
So c-c-c—

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.740
Sugi!

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.490
Are you okay? Hang in there!

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:14.860
My brain... My brain...

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.320
Crap. But everything's okay.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.610
Because this man likes 
slightly unhappy girls

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:23.530
and their embarrassed, unexpected smiles.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.700
She can't possibly be all of those things,

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.120
even if she is a princess...

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.880
And now, our honored hero 
will make an appearance!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.630
Hero, smile! Smile!

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.900
Justice is on our side!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:50.520
Episode 10

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:50.520
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a               .
Fantasy Knockout and a Rebel Army     .

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.330
Amazing, head maid!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:59.340
The uniforms you procured and
 your instructions on how to behave

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.580
made everything so easy!

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.220
<i>How did things end up like this?</i>

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.990
<i>And why do I have to get
 on stage like a pop idol?</i>

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.010
<i>And this skirt! It's too short!</i>

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:12.000
<i>It's impossible to ignore how drafty it is!</i>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.560
<i>The thought that that-which-must-not-be-seen
 might be seen is driving me mad!</i>

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.180
<i>And if I get too cold, 
it might upset my stomach!</i>

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.510
<i>I yearn for the tights I usually wear!</i>

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.500
<i>Plus, I can't shake this intense 
feeling of shame!</i>

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.310
<i>Being naked would be better!</i>

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.310
<i>I can't do this anymore! I'm gonna go change!</i>

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.120
Princess.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.380
I think it might be time 
to begin the next phase.

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.770
The next phase?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.030
Let us have an armed uprising.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.650
Violence is uncivilized.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:45.080
I'm having our precious 
citizens help us. That's all.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.360
I don't want them getting hurt.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.580
At the very worst,
 we'll use starvation tactics.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.650
I'll have them capitulate 
without any bloodshed.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.960
Understood. As you will, Your Highness.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.000
Has it been a year since 
you started serving me?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.300
I've been able to come this far
 because of the hero...

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.890
and the plan you thought up for me.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.550
Thank you.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.480
If you'll excuse me.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.400
Yes. I'll leave the rest to you.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.310
These tights make me feel so much better!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.820
This is how it should be!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.620
<i>The rebellion is going 
to keep going, isn't it?</i>

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.830
<i>Which means I'm gonna have to keep wearing 
this uniform in front of people.</i>

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.750
<i>Okay! I'll run away!</i>

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.560
<i>Sorry, Yggie.</i>

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:43.920
<i>I'm just not ready to be a mermaid, 
tempting people with bare legs.</i>

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.360
It's the hero!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.470
The hero has shown herself!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.020
Hero!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.880
Please show us the way!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.860
<i>First, I guess I'll look for the tiara
 the head maid took from me.</i>

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:07.610
<i>That said, I can't even guess 
where I should start looking.</i>

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.370
Is someone there?

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.620
Huh?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.550
What?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.510
When the head maid caught me, 
I had no idea what I was going to do!

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.880
For a sec, I thought you were 
interested in this kind of thing.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.880
I am not.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.830
Why don't you come back with me for now?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.390
Jinguuji-sama is worried, too.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.390
Don't follow me!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.800
<i>I was wondering about him 
not coming to get me,</i>

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.490
<i>but since we're talking about Jinguuji...</i>

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.100
<i>"Why don't you go travel 
with the princess then?"</i>

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.680
<i>That's what he's thinking. I'm sure of it.</i>

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.980
<i>He's so easy to read.</i>

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.220
How did things end up like this?!

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:50.960
Is someone there?

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:51.830
Oh! This is bad!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.270
Sorry, Mouria-chan!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.420
No!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:03.180
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:07.670
<i>Helpless... I'm completely powerless!</i>

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.430
Oh! Hero!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.680
Hero! Hero! Hero!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.430
Hero!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:20.680
<i>Oh, everything's going wrong!</i>

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.940
<i>I've managed to work through everything that's
 happened to me in this world one way or another.</i>

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:29.400
<i>No, wait. It's not that I did well.</i>

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.410
<i>It's just that I can't even do 
this much without Jinguuji's help.</i>

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.660
<i>I'm no hero.</i>

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:41.790
Tachibana-kun, it's amazing you can be with 
Jinguuji so much when you're like that.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.050
Are you sure he doesn't think 
you're causing him trouble?

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.050
What am I, really?

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.280
Has something happened, honored hero?

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:00.520
Does the fragrance of the tea
 not suit your tastes?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.440
No, it's not that!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:07.260
Head maid, am I really being useful?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.200
It seems you are a little tired, honored hero.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.560
Please leave everything to me.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.700
Huh? What's about to happen to me?

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.680
How is it?

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.130
The best!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:38.080
Hey, what is this slippery stuff?

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.340
Slime.

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.240
Sli—!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.140
It's a secret beauty regimen 
of the royal family.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.840
Beauty is a strange thing, isn't it?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:48.030
It can seduce or guide someone.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:54.120
Thanks to your beauty, honored hero, 
Her Highness's wish has been granted.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:57.460
I think you are definitely being helpful.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.640
H-Head maid!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.040
Thank you for consoling me!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:07.640
Lots of stuff has happened 
since I came to this world,

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.640
but the one who has dealt with 
all of it was Jinguuji.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.550
I wish he'd understand how I end up feeling 
like, "I don't think you need me."

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:16.300
Plus, he's seriously tired.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:20.810
I keep thinking that he might 
die because of me.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:24.560
How did things end up like this?

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.120
I have heard that your body was 
bestowed upon you by the goddess.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.070
You continue to face danger 
due to your beauty.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:37.320
You cannot do anything due to the frailness 
of your body. Thinking of it that way...

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.290
The goddess is the cause 
of everything, is she not?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.690
So it wasn't my fault?

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.290
Everything's the goddess's fault?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:51.500
Honored hero, I understand your worries.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:57.950
Though it may be presumptuous of me, 
I would like to help grant your wish.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.810
Yup. The best snack to pair 
with a drink has to be...

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.520
Ta-dah!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.820
Squid!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.960
It's time to watch over all the
 cute little ones on the ground

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.820
as I enjoy my evening drink!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:20.150
This is...

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:23.080
Have they finally started 
interfering directly?

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:25.550
You're jealous, aren't you?

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:29.080
Even though it's you who truly 
possesses the status of hero,

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:33.580
Jinuugi-sama keeps ignoring that, 
and you're envious of him, aren't you?

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.090
Let's keep our distance 
from him for a while.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.520
You will gain power.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.470
I will teach you how to do so.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.190
Yeah...

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.600
And we'll let everyone know...

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.320
what an outstanding human you are.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.260
Yeah...

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:57.110
<i>I had a dream about when I was little.</i>

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.990
<i>My vision was blurred with tears,</i>

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>so it might not have been a good dream.</i>

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:09.120
<i>I feel like elementary school was when 
there was the most irrational violence.</i>

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.620
<i>The one on the receiving 
end is simply miserable.</i>

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.160
<i>It hurts, it's infuriating, 
and it's frustrating.</i>

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.130
<i>Bullies know exactly what people 
don't want to have done to them.</i>

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.640
<i>And I think...</i>

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.640
<i>someone... anyone...</i>

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:31.900
<i>I wanted someone to beat these guys up for me.</i>

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.460
This guy's crazy!

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.450
Run!

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:39.400
Hey, you okay?

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.410
<i>This is my memory of the 
first time I met Jinguuji.</i>

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.350
Thanks.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.130
It's fine.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.670
If someone's in trouble, 
it's only natural to help.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.680
<i>We were in the same class, 
but he was always alone.</i>

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.170
<i>A guy I couldn't understand.</i>

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:02.800
Wow! You're doing judo? You're super strong!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.220
<i>I see. I'd never thought about it.</i>

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.730
<i>Ever since I met him...</i>

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:12.100
You were just like a ****!

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.920
<i>I ****** ** to him.</i>

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.050
<i>Was I jealous of him?</i>

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.000
<i>Somehow, I feel like I...</i>

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.040
****? What's that?

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.820
How can you possibly not know?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.010
<i>I'm a terrible guy.</i>

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.650
Huh? Did I fall asleep?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.130
Partway through your treatment.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.270
Really? Sorry.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.570
My body, condition, and mood 
all feel incredibly good.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:45.300
Thank you, head maid.

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:49.150
Not at all. I am glad if I have been of use.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.700
You must be tired.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.710
I think it would be best if you
 took today off and got some sleep.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.720
Yeah. I'll do that.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.120
G'night.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.250
Good night.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.070
This time, have an even more pleasant dream.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:09.950
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:07.070
Wow!

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:08.750
That's amazing!

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:11.940
I have a report!

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.460
That certain person has arrived!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.920
What? Let him through! Let him through!

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:18.550
<i>Certain person?</i>

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:22.540
E-Excuse the intrusion!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.970
Um, is it okay if I come in?

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:27.640
Oh!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.350
It's Jinguuji-san! I'm so glad! 
There's someone I know here!

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:35.350
Oh, it's Schwartz-kun. It's been a while.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.570
Yes, it's been a while! 
Huh? Where's Tachibana-san?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.030
Tachibana is with the princess.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.680
What? Princess? There's a princess?

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.360
Whoa! I wanna meet her. 
Do you think I can meet her?

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.870
Actually, I'm going to have an 
audience with the king of this land.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.020
I've got an audience. An audience!

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:54.200
I'm super nervous. For real!

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.640
Hilarious, right? Seriously.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:13:00.590
Oh, Jinguuji-san, are you sort 
of waiting for an audience, too?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.380
Schwartz-kun.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.270
This is the king of this land.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:05.850
Huh?

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.380
Yes.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.400
What an energetic youth.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.080
Just a little older than 
my daughter, I think.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.480
I'm sorry. Can I start over from my entrance?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.520
Do as you wish.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.030
It is a pleasure to meet you, Your Majesty!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.410
My name is Schwartz von Lichtenstein—

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.980
Your Majesty, we have offered great offense.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.790
N-Not at all. Raise your heads.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.310
You have suffered many hardships.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:35.840
Thank you for coming.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.790
To get straight to the point, Lord Schwartz,

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:42.450
due to a rebellion lead 
by my beloved daughter, Yggie,

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.050
this kingdom is in a very perilous state.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.400
Her speeches have convinced villagers and
 castle townsfolk alike to join her faction,

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.440
and they have become a great military force.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:57.100
Perhaps due to a lack of leadership, 
a portion of them are said to be rioting.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.920
However...

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:04.260
for many years, we've been in a stalemate 
with the country across the sea from us.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:07.170
We must focus our military there.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.320
That is why we lack the manpower 
for a suppression force.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.870
If possible, we do not want 
to use our last resort.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.870
<i>Last resort?</i>

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:19.620
Will you save our kingdom, Lord Schwartz?

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.670
All right! Let's do it!

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.790
If you'll excuse us for a moment.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:25.980
Y-Yes.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:34.610
Schwartz, I've told you to stop 
answering without thinking.

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:38.280
There's the chance they'll use your status 
as hero, leaving you caught in some plot!

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:40.020
But, master...

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:44.310
If there's rioting, then the village 
and the people are in danger...

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.740
I can think about where I stand later.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.960
If there are people in trouble, 
I want to save them.

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.200
If my strength can be of use...

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.200
That's enough for now, isn't it?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.420
Schwartz...

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:03.930
Wow! Master, did you make dinner today?

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:08.060
Master, I will overcome this! This wall!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.130
One day, master, I'd like 
to visit your homeland.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.470
Master!

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:20.890
<i>Can it be true that Schwartz has grown 
enough to say something like this?</i>

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.420
What's wrong, master?!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.700
Did I mess up again somehow?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:30.880
You should do what you want to do.

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.740
What? Can I?

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:34.990
Your Majesty!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.960
What is it that we should do?

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.870
M-Master...

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.120
What should I do about this?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.380
And why are you so far away?!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.970
Who d'you think you are, huh?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.430
What're you looking at, huh?

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:55.680
You wanna get beat to death, huh?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.680
Underestimate us and we're not 
gonna go easy on you, get it?!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:01.760
To start with, shall we try talking?

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:02.960
I see!

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:06.640
Even if we're up against people like that, 
we should learn about them first, right?

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.190
That's just like you, master!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.240
Young people!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.630
We are done with listening to 
your oppressive verbal attacks!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.250
My name is Schwartz von Lichten—

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.120
This is simply a riot and nothing more!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.610
This is the order of the king!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.460
If you disperse now, all is well!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.870
Otherwise, you shall become 
dew on my sword and fall!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:27.340
Dew on a sword? What a fancy, 
roundabout way to talk!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.320
Unforgivable.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:31.010
Make it easy to understand and say 
you're gonna beat us to death!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.540
This is "talking"?

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.140
What good would speaking 
nicely to criminals do?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.650
There's only two of you? 
What're you gonna do?

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.140
We're never gonna disband!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:46.980
Spreading word of the hero and princess's beauty
 throughout the world is our sacred duty!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.400
Huh? Was that the reason for the rebellion?!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.970
We'll start with the royal capital!

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:53.400
Let's do it!

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:55.910
What should we do, master?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.260
Do it.

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.330
Huh? Do it? Me?

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.300
How long will you fear the 
strength of that sword?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:07.340
You shouldn't be pushed around 
by power. You should use it!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.920
Remember, Schwartz!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.840
Think back to those days of
 harsh training spent with me!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.840
That sword of yours will cut 
through whatever you desire.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.850
Isn't that right?

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.730
What're you nattering on about?!

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.270
Quit pretending you aren't freaking out!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.020
Oh! No...ble Treasures!

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.980
Y-Yes! I did it!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.530
Did you see that, master?

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.850
Yes, I did.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.840
This is the true might 
of the holy sword, Gram!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:46.700
I'm so glad! Gram, I'm really so glad!

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:50.040
When you got eaten by that 
armor, I thought that was it!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:51.630
Huh?

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.000
Why are we all standing out
 in a field buck naked?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.050
In front of the royal capital at that...

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.640
And there's only men here...

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.640
Should we head home?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.050
Huh?

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:04.660
Yeah. Since we have the opportunity 
and everything, let's head home naked!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.060
Retreat!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:11.260
Master, we won... right?

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:17.960
Schwartz, that sword may be even 
more amazing than we'd imagined.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:20.940
Please praise me too, master!

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.780
If you'll excuse me!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.680
I got praised.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:34.520
And by the king himself!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.610
Being praised by the king...

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:39.340
Now that's getting reincarnated 
in another world!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:44.100
It feels like my reincarnation into 
another world is finally getting stared!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.800
Man, I'm so happy! 
It's like my spring has come.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:50.900
Yes, yes. Wow, amazing. 
You're so impressive.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.110
Does this mean I'm on the princess route?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.280
Should I go ahead and save this kingdom?

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.510
If you get too cocky...

00:18:58.510 --> 00:18:59.610
I'll punch you.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.010
Ow...

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.620
Huh? Oh, it's Jinguuji-san!

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.840
Jinguuji-san!

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:11.120
Listen to this! My reincarnation into 
another world has finally gotten started!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.380
Really? I'm happy for you.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.880
Could it be that Jinguuji-san 
has been like this

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:22.980
ever since he separated 
from Tachibana-san?

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:27.390
Yes. There's no point in 
playing with him anymore.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:33.060
Tachibana-san only cheated on
 Jinguuji-san a little, and he's like this.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.940
It seems Jinguuji-san was 
born of humans after all.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.530
"Cheated"?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.820
Did you just say "cheated"?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:43.220
Who cheated on who? Tell me.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:48.100
It seems you're mistaken about 
my relationship with Tachibana.

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.440
<i>Huh? What is this?</i>

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.740
<i>Is he human?</i>

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:55.960
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.050
<i>I'm really feeling it in my legs!</i>

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.080
<i>They're moving in a way 
I've never seen before!</i>

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.220
<i>And it's got nothing to do with my will.</i>

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.540
<i>They're moving with insane speed!</i>

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.930
<i>This is crazy! Insane!
 My whole body's gone crazy!</i>

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.840
<i>I have to apologize. 
I have to apologize right now!</i>

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:14.480
<i>B-But...</i>

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.230
<i>Did I say something wrong?!</i>

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:22.520
That's right. My name is Schwartz 
von Lichtenstein Lohengramm!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.740
I am a hero who will save the world!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:30.750
<i>Is it right for a hero to shrink 
from an old guy in a suit?!</i>

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.170
<i>It's begun, hasn't it? My road to success?</i>

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.750
<i>I've seen it, haven't I? 
The path to becoming a savior?</i>

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.960
You seem worried about 
something, Jinguuji-san.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:42.840
Impossible!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.510
He was confronted with that much
 bloodlust and withstood it?!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:51.020
If you don't mind it being me... 
I'll listen to your worries.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:52.750
Worries?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.760
I have no worries.

00:20:58.350 --> 00:20:59.210
Huh?

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:02.350
I really thought you were 
worried about Tachibana-san.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.850
If that's what you saw, you were mistaken.

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:08.780
In the first place, Tachibana went with 
the princess willingly. I have no—

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:09.720
Wait!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:14.000
Jinguuji-san, you were left 
behind by Tachibana-san,

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.540
so you're just feeling depressed? That's all?

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:21.820
Stop making false accusations. 
I'm feeling great.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:23.800
You're buckling all over!

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:28.380
Anyway, if she herself wants to be 
with the princess, that's that.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:31.810
Did you hear that from her personally?

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:36.190
<i>No, he definitely didn't ask her.</i>

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.570
Jinguuji-san, could it be that you're...

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.570
making your feelings of jealousy worse?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:49.020
Do you want to make me angry?

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.190
You're letting your bloodlust loose again!

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:55.080
If you think doing that's going to make 
everything go your way, you're wrong!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:58.560
Why would there be jealousy 
between two men?!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.960
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.220
Everyone, it's been a while!

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.230
This is Schwartz von Lichtenstein Lohengramm!

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:41.860
Did you see everything I did today?

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:44.250
I know I shouldn't say it 
myself, but, man! It's here!

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 11 

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:45.540
The wind's really blowing my way!

00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:47.750
Maybe a spin-off or something.
I think an offer like that's possible!

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:49.990
Actually, I'll be waiting for it! So thanks!
